{title: Arise, My Soul, Arise}
{artist: Charles Wesley}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 88}

Verse 1
A[F]rise, my soul, a[Bb]rise, shake [C]off thy guilty [F]fears:
the bleeding Sacri[Bb]fice in [C]my behalf ap[F]pears.
Before the throne my [C]Surety stands, be[F]fore the throne my [C]Surety stands —
my [F]name is [Bb]written [C]on his [F]hands.
